ormat, brought into VR with customizable theater seating and environments!\n\nStereoscopic Movie in Full 360 experience\nCustomizable viewing experience\nGreat for a laugh!\n\nTRT: 6:55 minutes", "short_description": "An amusing battle of wits between a frustrated artist and his reluctant feline model. This delightful 3D short has been a hit with festival audiences, won the Audience Favorite award at 3D-Con, and was an official selection at the Mill Valley International Film Festival. Using the secret techniques revealed in this film, you too will be able to draw a cat.\n\nStereoscopic Movie in Full 360 experience\nCustomizable viewing experience\nGreat for a laugh!\n\nTRT: 6:55 minutes"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://rgb3d.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://rgb3d.com/", "publisher_name": "RGB3D", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://rgb3d.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "MOVIE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "649261796330686"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162730_337569563356247_8711676741380210688_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Te2JiRbXOFcQ7kNvwHPp5p4&_nc_oc=AdoyX8518Ww-qw_TK7yHzS0DoVrivSlS-lVisJ-5iTMUu73fRPOrRk5h-c1bW8BSdjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0rkbK7dzE4Rt6XzqKms0MLlHZ6KLiRQLzTkHAEiq6QWA&oe=69DF7E7B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_v